    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20286" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βολίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>missile, javelin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Demetr.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sounding-lead</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.80
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστραπῶν βολίδες</span>
			<i>flashes</i> of lightning, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				5.21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστραπὴ βολίς</span> (sic)
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Za.</u>
				9.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>cast of the dice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.767
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>die</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				768
			</span></i> (Id.).</div>
